  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nIt would be nice to have homarr to perform a automatic service discovery for Docker-Containers.\nMy sugesstion would be to add docker labels to the container and use these to fill the dashboard.\nHomepage does this for example in the following way:\n`labels:\n      - homepage.group=Media\n      - homepage.name=Emby\n      - homepage.icon=emby.png\n      - homepage.href=http://emby.home/\n      - homepage.description=Media server`\nIt would be nice, to also set configure the integrations with the labels.\n\n### Additional information\n\nOriginally posted https://github.com/ajnart/homarr/issues/1468\n\nProbably would be a good idea to then also have some sort of widget / section where the discovered services are listed automatically with some filters",
